  "merger_description": "Sanad Services Group owned by One Hundred and Seven Investment RSC LTD \u2013 Sole Proprietorship L.L.C. (**Sanad Services**) and Ace A\u00e9ro Partenaires II S.L.P. (**AAP2**) (an investment fund) propose to acquire Revima Holding SAS (**Revima**).\n\nRevima supplies maintenance, repair and overhaul (**MRO**) services for aircraft auxiliary power units (**APUs**) and aircraft landing gear systems. Revima also supplies, to a more limited extent, MRO services for engine parts (but not MRO services for complete engines). Revima services customers globally from its MRO facilities in France and Thailand.\n\nSanad Services supplies MRO services for aircraft engines and related aftermarket services. Sanad Services provides these services to customers globally from its facilities in the UAE. Samad Services is ultimately owned by Mubadala Investment Company PJSC (**MIC**), a UAE public joint stock company wholly owned by the Government of Abu Dhabi.\n\nAAP2 is an investment fund represented by Tikehau Investment Management SAS (**TIM**), in its capacity as management company. TIM is itself a wholly owned subsidiary of Tikehau Capital SCA, the parent company of the Tikehau Capital group, a France-based global asset management and investment group.",
